#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: dd2d6ff88b5c4fe5b272d8a662739718
msgid "**Startup (plugin load)** — State `sensor_msgs/JointState` topic"
msgstr "**启动时（插件加载）** — 状态 `sensor_msgs/JointState` 话题"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 0bea2750fdb949eda41d77daa79759ee
