#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 3ead0654be674c93b28e15cd67519cdc
msgid "`true` (README: recommended for real hardware)"
msgstr "`true`（README：真机建议）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 5a972b0c05724eceb6ec567f2b0203c4
msgid ""
"**Startup (plugin load)** — `true`: first received state becomes the "
"command (avoids a jump). `false`: use state_interface `initial_value`"
msgstr ""
"**启动时（插件加载）** — `true`：用首次收到的状态作为命令（避免突跳）。`false`：使用 state_interface 的 "
"`initial_value`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 4c053210df38467c96d39fd5fb8cfd50
msgid "`trigger_joint_command_threshold`"
msgstr "`trigger_joint_command_threshold`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 721e10491c084f21a5d99c261176cd4d
msgid "`1e-5` (source; not in README)"
msgstr "`1e-5`（源码；README 未写）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 3839f45eb3054ddaac0761cf3695bef1
msgid ""
"**Startup (plugin load)** — Skip publish when command vs state is below "
"this delta"
msgstr "**启动时（插件加载）** — 命令与状态之差低于此阈值时不发布"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 302368b5ec1347e6a9b85c7d48258c64
msgid "`sum_wrapped_joint_states`"
msgstr "`sum_wrapped_joint_states`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 738ef77741a74c4b90221dd6e1f6ccc9
msgid "`\"false\"` (source; not in README)"
msgstr "`\"false\"`（源码；README 未写）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 9ffa1f4f781649baa3fdb7b4feff32f1
msgid "**Startup (plugin load)** — `\"true\"`: unwrap ±2π (Isaac-style wrapping)"
msgstr "**启动时（插件加载）** — `\"true\"`：展开 ±2π（Isaac 式环绕）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 541eaa0be80f4498b183705dcaf03579
msgid "`joint_name_prefix`"
msgstr "`joint_name_prefix`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: 5f6a4fd264dc4291a61045d8bb920bd3
msgid "`\"\"` (source; not in README)"
msgstr "`\"\"`（源码；README 未写）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:17
#: d30c977c192949e78a683074076cbe2e
msgid ""
"**Startup (plugin load)** — Strip this prefix from hardware joint names "
"when matching topic names"
msgstr "**启动时（插件加载）** — 匹配话题关节名时去掉硬件关节名上的此前缀"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:37
#: 9a3c2d5b79974d00b5da87fa573f3b00
msgid ""
"Per-joint `initial_value` on a `state_interface` is used when "
"`initialize_commands_from_state` is `false`. Joint `mimic` / `multiplier`"
" are standard ros2_control joint parameters read at the same `on_init`."
msgstr ""
"当 `initialize_commands_from_state` 为 `false` 时，使用各关节 `state_interface` 上的"
" `initial_value`。关节 `mimic` / `multiplier` 是同一 `on_init` 读取的标准 "
"ros2_control 关节参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:39
#: 19894594b7234abb889b0e4847bfc016
msgid ""
"Change any of these by editing the xacro (or the overlay that generates "
"it) and **restarting** the hardware. There is no `on_set_parameters` path"
" in this plugin."
msgstr "要改这些值，请编辑 xacro（或生成它的 overlay）并**重启**硬件。此插件没有 `on_set_parameters` 路径。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:41
#: bb377a4b00ba47cab50090f77f32b74a
msgid "Isaac Sim: [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr "Isaac Sim：[Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:43
#: 612f6f9f00704ae7a756f7571bdf99bf
msgid "Other public hardware interfaces"
msgstr "其他公开硬件接口"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:45
#: 769ac260033747fbb036ae5fc6bb8ba2
msgid ""
"Vendor plugins and the `<param>` names already listed on [Public hardware"
" interfaces](1-public_hi.md) (for example ARX `can_interface`, Dobot "
"`robot_ip` / `robot_port`, HighTorque `serial_port`, Modbus `serial_port`"
" / `baudrate`). Those pages are the parameter lists. They are xacro "
"`<param>` values at plugin load — same **Startup (plugin load)** rule as "
"above."
msgstr ""
"厂商插件以及已列在[公开硬件接口](1-public_hi.md) 上的 `<param>` 名称（例如 ARX 的 "
"`can_interface`、Dobot 的 `robot_ip` / `robot_port`、HighTorque 的 "
"`serial_port`、Modbus 的 `serial_port` / `baudrate`）。那些页面就是参数列表。它们是插件加载时的 "
"xacro `<param>` — 规则同上，**启动时（插件加载）**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:47
#: bedce0d87e6342058e66d527f13c494a
msgid "Use the plugin class from that robot’s `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro`."
msgstr "插件类以该机型 `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` 为准。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:49
#: 07524302cb32464dae734ac988c4858e
msgid "Private hardware interfaces"
msgstr "私有硬件接口"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:51
#: 3ed5b7fd15174dc4add9239b0e452a82
msgid ""
"[Private hardware interfaces](2-private_hi.md) names the private packages"
" (Rokae, Eyou, iNex, Wuji, DexCap, Fairino). Configuration keys, "
"IP/serial layouts, and SDK env vars are in **that repository’s README "
"after access**. This page does not list undocumented private SDK "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"[私有硬件接口](2-private_hi.md) "
"列出私有包（Rokae、Eyou、iNex、Wuji、DexCap、Fairino）。配置键、IP/串口布局和 SDK 环境变量见**开通后该仓库"
" README**。本页不罗列未文档化的私有 SDK 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:53
#: a2e9f252b3384d47974fea003bf9c831
msgid "SDK build notes: [SDK Notes](3-sdk_notes.md)."
msgstr "SDK 编译说明：[SDK 说明](3-sdk_notes.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:55
#: 68a92b5f66f44d30b134896110748235
msgid "OCS2 `.info` files"
msgstr "OCS2 `.info` 文件"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md:57
#: 78180dd8b6ab43ee8c7bbfc790e5498a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info` (and the generated library under"
" `config/ocs2/generated`) are **OCS2 task / model files**, not ROS 2 "
"parameters. The controller ROS param `info_file_name` (default `task`) "
"only chooses which `.info` to load at startup — [Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info`（以及 `config/ocs2/generated` "
"下的生成库）是 **OCS2 任务 / 模型文件**，不是 ROS 2 参数。控制器 ROS 参数 `info_file_name`（默认 "
"`task`）只在启动时选择加载哪份 `.info` — [控制器 ROS 2 "
"参数](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)。"

